{"id":5434,"date":"2025-03-06T06:31:49","date_gmt":"2025-03-06T14:31:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/penserra.com\/?p=5434"},"modified":"2025-05-30T07:04:45","modified_gmt":"2025-05-30T14:04:45","slug":"penserra-proudly-recognizes-our-valued-female-colleagues-on-international-womens-day-2025","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/penserra.com\/penserra-proudly-recognizes-our-valued-female-colleagues-on-international-womens-day-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Penserra Proudly Recognizes Our Valued Female Colleagues on International Women\u2019s Day 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Penserra proudly recognizes our valued female colleagues on International Women\u2019s Day and ardently supports the 2025 theme of <strong>#AccelerateAction.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Collectively, we can\u00a0<strong>Accelerate Action<\/strong>\u00a0for gender equality.<\/p>\n<p>Step forward in solidarity for International Women&#8217;s Day (IWD) 2025 on March 8 to help\u00a0<strong>#AccelerateAction<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>At the current rate of progress, it will take\u00a0until 2158,\u00a0which is roughly five generations from now, to reach full gender parity, according to data from the World Economic Forum.<\/p>\n<p>Focusing on the need to\u00a0<strong>Accelerate Action<\/strong>\u00a0emphasizes the importance of taking swift and decisive steps to achieve gender equality. It calls for increased momentum and urgency in addressing the systemic barriers and biases that women face, both in personal and professional spheres.<\/p>\n<p>So, together, let&#8217;s\u00a0<strong>Accelerate Action<\/strong>\u00a0to\u00a0speed up the rate of progress worldwide.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-5435 size-medium lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/IWD-2025-500x256.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"256\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/IWD-2025-500x256.webp 500w, h